// `u8` IS A FULLY WORKING COLUMN AND IS REFUSED AS A MAPPING PARAMETER — ONE
// TIER DISAGREEING WITH ITSELF, BY A FOUR-NAME LIST IN THE C++ FRONT END.
//
// WHAT IS PINNED. `wql_domain_static_extremes` runs `select s.x` and
// `order by s.x` over a `u8` column at 0, 128 and 255 and both answer
// correctly; `wql_domain_runtime_extremes` does the same through the dynamic
// engine. The 2026-08-03 survey found `u8` green at select, `where <`,
// `order by`, `group by`, `distinct` and `join` in the static tier. The same
// type, in the same tier, as a mapping scalar parameter, is refused against a
// list of four names written in `src/compiler/sema_expr.cpp` — "params after the
// source must be scalars (i64/f64/str/bool)".
//
// THE POPULATION THAT DISAGREES IS NOT SMALL. Every type outside those four
// names is in it: i8, i16, i32, i128, u8, u16, u32, u64, u128, isize, usize,
// i24, u24, i56, u56, f32 and every user type. That is the FIFTH of the seven
// places the value domain is written down, and the only one that lives in C++.
// The others are the `rel` column's `Hash` query, the 21-row `el_ty_stored`
// table, `enum RtVal` with `QRows`' five getters, `impl WritField` (nineteen
// types), `el_ty_of_name`'s lenient INT default, and `agg_result_ty`/`el_quot_ty`
// returning a class rather than a type.
//
// ⚠ THE EXPECTATION IS NOT THE DEFECT — THE DISAGREEMENT IS. The refusal is
// well-formed: it names the mapping, the parameter, its type and the admitted
// set, at the user's own line. What it may not do is disagree with the column
// rule one syntactic position away. When the value domain becomes the type
// system this list stops being a list, this file goes red, and it should be
// rewritten to state whatever the derived rule then admits.
//
// ⚠ ONE THING THIS FILE DOES NOT ASSERT, ON PURPOSE. The full diagnostic carries
// a context tag `[fn Arc__deref_mut]` — a function that has nothing to do with
// the mapping and comes from wherever the diagnostic sink happened to be. It is
// left out of the expectation because asserting it would pin a bug in the
// diagnostic machinery as though it were the message, and because the message
// itself is what identifies the layer.
package test;

use logos.lang.writ.container;
use logos.mem.writ.parser;
use logos.std.wql.wql;
use logos.std.wql.mapping_item;
use logos.mem.collections.vec;

mapping M(g: &Writ, floor: u8) {
    pub rel over(key: str, v: i64) {
        from g ** x {i64} where x.vi >= floor select (x.key, x.vi);
    }
}

fn main() -> i32 { return 0i32; }
